request.description:
Get the authenticated user's Flutterwave wallet details.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "subaccount": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "account_reference": "PSA14B6C11AE18421012",
      "barter_id": "234000003363471",
      "account_bank": "Wema Bank PLC",
      "account_number": "7353333250",
      "business_name": "User Name",
      "email": "user@example.com",
      "is_active": true
    }
  }
}
```

Get the balance of the user's Flutterwave wallet.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "balance": 50000.00,
    "currency": "NGN"
  }
}
```

Get all saved bank accounts for the user.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "bank_accounts": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "account_number": "0123456789",
        "account_name": "JOHN DOE",
        "bank_code": "044",
        "bank_name": "Access Bank",
        "is_default": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

Get list of Nigerian banks.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "banks": [
      {"id": 1, "code": "044", "name": "Access Bank"},
      {"id": 2, "code": "035", "name": "Wema Bank"}
    ]
  }
}
```

Verify bank account details.

**Request Body:**
- `account_number`: 10-digit account number
- `bank_code`: Bank code from List Banks

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "account": {
      "account_number": "0123456789",
      "account_name": "JOHN DOE"
    }
  }
}
```

Get wallet balance.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "currency": "NGN",
    "available_balance": 50000.00,
    "ledger_balance": 50000.00
  }
}
```

List all wallets with pagination.

**Query Params:**
- `limit`: Number of results per page
- `next_cursor`: Cursor from previous response for pagination

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": {
    "payout_subaccounts": [
      {
        "id": 4058,
        "account_reference": "PSAC6A05465972178946",
        "account_name": "John Doe",
        "barter_id": "234000001536470",
        "email": "john@example.com",
        "nuban": "8222459588",
        "bank_name": "Sterling Bank PLC",
        "status": "ACTIVE"
      }
    ],
    "cursor": {
      "next": 5040,
      "limit": 10,
      "has_more_items": true
    }
  }
}
```

Get list of Nigerian banks.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": [
    {"id": 1, "code": "044", "name": "Access Bank"},
    {"id": 2, "code": "035", "name": "Wema Bank"},
    {"id": 3, "code": "232", "name": "Sterling Bank"}
  ]
}
```
